{"type": "say", "text": "Good morning everyone. Before we get started, let's go through the current draft build package so we can get all department signoffs today. As it stands, we're looking at one 700 kg scenic platform, a red fabric backdrop, and a west-side camera entrance on Stage 4 for the musical number. I need each department to confirm they're good with this or flag any required changes before I issue the final build package to the scenic crew. Who'd like to start?"}
