{"type": "reveal", "fact_id": "PF2", "text": "I need to flag a required change on the fabric backdrop. I confirmed with our fabric supplier this morning that the only available backdrop material with the required flame-retardant certification is 180 meters of Slate Gray FR-7. The red fabric specified in the draft package has no current certification, so we'll need to update the backdrop to Slate Gray FR-7 before we can proceed. I'm still waiting on the purchase order, but the material availability and certification are confirmed."}
```

